      "created_at": "2018-11-23T12:54:04Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-11-23T12:54:04Z",
      "body": "This actually can be done by setting this config.php option:\r\n\r\n```php\r\n'session_keepalive' => false,\r\n```\r\n\r\nThen the polling for notifications and heartbeat will not happen and the session can timeout.",
